#ASSERT `s 29A(4) the change of name has become effective and the charitable company is exempted` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 29A(4) the change of name has become effective and the charitable company is exempted` FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
